    <item>
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/project/introduction/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 May 2023 00:44:31 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/project/introduction/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;digibiogashubs&#34;&gt;DigiBioGasHubs &lt;a href=&#34;#digibiogashubs&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;material-icons align-middle&#34;&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;    &#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/images/DBH_logo_en_up.png&#34; alt=&#34;Project Logo&#34; width=&#34;1920&#34; height=&#34;1080&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;    &#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/images/funder-logo-en.png&#34; alt=&#34;Funder Logo&#34; width=&#34;4119&#34; height=&#34;919&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;Project is funded by the European Regional Development Fund.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;short-project-description&#34;&gt;Short Project Description &lt;a href=&#34;#short-project-description&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;material-icons align-middle&#34;&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.12.2023 - 30.11.2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Dependence on fossil fuels, the need to decrease the number of CO2 emissions, the large amount of waste and unused material flows, and the necessity to increase the resilience of the energy system and regional energy self-sufficiency and food and supply security challenge actors to develop circular economy solutions and increase the share of renewable energy sources in the energy system. Biogas plays a key role in solving the aforementioned challenges.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Platform</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/project/platform/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 May 2023 00:44:31 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/project/platform/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;digibiogashubs-platform&#34;&gt;DigiBioGasHubs Platform &lt;a href=&#34;#digibiogashubs-platform&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;material-icons align-middle&#34;&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;DigiBioGasHubs platform is a digital marketplace designed to connect stakeholders in the biogas ecosystem. It enables users to offer or request biogas-related products and services, supporting collaboration and interaction between different actors. The platform aims to facilitate the development of biogas hubs (clusters) in various regions, promote the circular economy, and increase the share of renewable energy sources in the energy system. Key features include tools for marketplace listings, knowledge sharing, and ecosystem coordination.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Getting Started</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/get-started/gettingstarted/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 May 2023 00:44:31 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/get-started/gettingstarted/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting Started &lt;a href=&#34;#getting-started&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;material-icons align-middle&#34;&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;    &#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/images/structure.png&#34; alt=&#34;Project Overview&#34; width=&#34;754&#34; height=&#34;479&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Project is split into five separate repositories + documentation&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Frontend. &lt;strong&gt;THIS IS REQUIRED&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHub&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHub&lt;svg width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M14 5c-.552 0-1-.448-1-1s.448-1 1-1h6c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v6c0 .552-.448 1-1 1s-1-.448-1-1v-3.586l-7.293 7.293c-.391.39-1.024.39-1.414 0-.391-.391-.391-1.024 0-1.414l7.293-7.293h-3.586zm-9 2c-.552 0-1 .448-1 1v11c0 .552.448 1 1 1h11c.552 0 1-.448 1-1v-4.563c0-.552.448-1 1-1s1 .448 1 1v4.563c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3h-11c-1.657 0-3-1.343-3-3v-11c0-1.657 1.343-3 3-3h4.563c.552 0 1 .448 1 1s-.448 1-1 1h-4.563z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Backend &lt;strong&gt;THIS IS REQUIRED&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHub-backend&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHub-backend&lt;svg width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M14 5c-.552 0-1-.448-1-1s.448-1 1-1h6c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v6c0 .552-.448 1-1 1s-1-.448-1-1v-3.586l-7.293 7.293c-.391.39-1.024.39-1.414 0-.391-.391-.391-1.024 0-1.414l7.293-7.293h-3.586zm-9 2c-.552 0-1 .448-1 1v11c0 .552.448 1 1 1h11c.552 0 1-.448 1-1v-4.563c0-.552.448-1 1-1s1 .448 1 1v4.563c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3h-11c-1.657 0-3-1.343-3-3v-11c0-1.657 1.343-3 3-3h4.563c.552 0 1 .448 1 1s-.448 1-1 1h-4.563z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ChatServer &lt;strong&gt;THIS IS REQUIRED&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHubs-Chat-Server&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHubs-Chat-Server&lt;svg width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M14 5c-.552 0-1-.448-1-1s.448-1 1-1h6c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v6c0 .552-.448 1-1 1s-1-.448-1-1v-3.586l-7.293 7.293c-.391.39-1.024.39-1.414 0-.391-.391-.391-1.024 0-1.414l7.293-7.293h-3.586zm-9 2c-.552 0-1 .448-1 1v11c0 .552.448 1 1 1h11c.552 0 1-.448 1-1v-4.563c0-.552.448-1 1-1s1 .448 1 1v4.563c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3h-11c-1.657 0-3-1.343-3-3v-11c0-1.657 1.343-3 3-3h4.563c.552 0 1 .448 1 1s-.448 1-1 1h-4.563z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;CubeJS &lt;strong&gt;THIS IS REQUIRED&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBiogasHubsCube&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBiogasHubsCube&lt;svg width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M14 5c-.552 0-1-.448-1-1s.448-1 1-1h6c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v6c0 .552-.448 1-1 1s-1-.448-1-1v-3.586l-7.293 7.293c-.391.39-1.024.39-1.414 0-.391-.391-.391-1.024 0-1.414l7.293-7.293h-3.586zm-9 2c-.552 0-1 .448-1 1v11c0 .552.448 1 1 1h11c.552 0 1-.448 1-1v-4.563c0-.552.448-1 1-1s1 .448 1 1v4.563c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3h-11c-1.657 0-3-1.343-3-3v-11c0-1.657 1.343-3 3-3h4.563c.552 0 1 .448 1 1s-.448 1-1 1h-4.563z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Docker for PostgreSQL OPTIONAL (&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHub-database&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/CentriaUniversityOfAppliedSciences/DigiBioGasHub-database&lt;svg width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M14 5c-.552 0-1-.448-1-1s.448-1 1-1h6c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v6c0 .552-.448 1-1 1s-1-.448-1-1v-3.586l-7.293 7.293c-.391.39-1.024.39-1.414 0-.391-.391-.391-1.024 0-1.414l7.293-7.293h-3.586zm-9 2c-.552 0-1 .448-1 1v11c0 .552.448 1 1 1h11c.552 0 1-.448 1-1v-4.563c0-.552.448-1 1-1s1 .448 1 1v4.563c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3h-11c-1.657 0-3-1.343-3-3v-11c0-1.657 1.343-3 3-3h4.563c.552 0 1 .448 1 1s-.448 1-1 1h-4.563z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
