    <item>
      <title>Marketplace</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/marketplace/marketplace/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 May 2023 00:44:31 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/DigiBioGasHubs/docs/marketplace/marketplace/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;marketplace&#34;&gt;Marketplace &lt;a href=&#34;#marketplace&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;material-icons align-middle&#34;&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The DigiBioGasHubs Marketplace is a core feature of the platform, providing a digital space where users can offer or request biogas and biomass products and services. It enables efficient matching between supply and demand within the biogas ecosystem. Key functions include:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Listing Offers and Requests&lt;/strong&gt;: Users can create, browse, and manage listings for biogas, biomass, and related services.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Filtering&lt;/strong&gt;: Advanced tools allow users to filter listings by criteria such as product type, price, and availability.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geographical Map View&lt;/strong&gt;: Listings can be visualized on a map, helping users find resources and partners nearby.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Integrated chat functionality enables users to communicate directly regarding marketplace listings.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company and User Profiles&lt;/strong&gt;: Organizations and individuals can showcase their offerings and credentials, supporting trust and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Admin Tools&lt;/strong&gt;: Administrators can manage listings, moderate content, and oversee marketplace operations.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
